<title>UK: Sweden sets $500 mln seven-year bond, 18 b.p. over.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets $500 mln seven-year bond, 18 b.p. over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    27.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/SE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 30.APR.02. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
